	(descr "Ai-Thinker Ra-02 LoRa module (Semtech SX1278, 433MHz, IPEX antenna socket), SMD-16 castellated pads, 2.0mm pitch, module 17x16mm. Pad numbers follow the physical module pinout: left column top-to-bottom = pads 1-8 (GND, GND, 3.3V, RESET, DIO0-DIO3); right column top-to-bottom = pads 16-9 (GND, NSS, MOSI, MISO, SCK, DIO5, DIO4, GND). Place module with its digital row over the left column. Pads 3.0x1.4mm extend 1.5mm beyond the module edge for hand soldering.")
	(tags "LoRa SX1278 Ai-Thinker Ra-02 castellated")
